cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reuse this code or the derived figures, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Viral hepatitis in Honduras, 2014–2024: a decade-long analysis of hospitalizations and mortality linked to EPI coverage, with genomic characterization of HBV"
abstract: "Reproducible analytical script that characterizes hospitalizations and mortality from viral hepatitis (ICD-10 B15–B19) in Honduras during 2014–2024, their temporal relationship with Expanded Program on Immunization (EPI) coverage, and the molecular characterization of the only available Honduran hepatitis B virus (HBV) sequences. It generates the figures, tables, and statistics of the work accepted as an e-poster at the XXIV National Course and V National Congress of Infectious Diseases (SHEI), Tegucigalpa, Honduras, 14–16 October 2026, and of the extended abstract deposited as a preprint."
